; Exported entry points for the Vulkan loader.
; The loader finds an implicit layer through vkNegotiateLoaderLayerInterfaceVersion
; (interface v2), which hands back the two GetProcAddr entry points named in the
; layer manifest (dlss5-vk-bridge.json). Everything else is reached through the
; dispatch chain and must NOT be exported.
LIBRARY dlss5-vk-bridge
EXPORTS
    vkNegotiateLoaderLayerInterfaceVersion
    dlss5vk_GetInstanceProcAddr
    dlss5vk_GetDeviceProcAddr
